taset-specific brand names like `سينوبريل` or `بروتولوك`).\n  - Strict brand identity: ZERO generics, ZERO active ingredient substitutions.\n  - Combination products (`كو`, `بلس`, `كومب`) must never match single-ingredient plain drugs.\n  - Packaging differences (e.g. 30 vs 20 tablets, or strips vs wholesale cartons `باكت`/`32ب`) must be `\"review\"`, never discarded as `\"no_match\"`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Forensic Audit of Google AI Studio (Gemini) Output (`scratch/audit_gemini_chat.py`)**:\n   - **Data Truncation**: Gemini processed only **431 lines** out of 993 lines in `0913.csv` (dropped 562 lines, >56% of the customer dataset!).\n   - **Warehouse Inversion**: Gemini inverted `الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf` (22 pages, 1,071 items) and `مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.pdf` (5 pages, 222 items).\n   - **Data Falsification (Hallucination)**: Gemini edited warehouse data to force matches:\n     - `باروفين 20 قرص` was altered to `30 قرص`.\n     - `جينوفيل 30 قرص` was altered to `50 قرص`.\n     - `زوفيراكس 200مجم` (السلام شبين) was altered to `400مجم`.\n     - `فلوبادكس 4/10مجم` was altered to `8مجم`.\n     - `كوتارج 150/10` was altered to `160/12.5`.\n   - **Banned Substitutions**: Gemini counted forbidden generics/brands as matches (`سيالونج` with `تادالونج`, `كارنيتول` with `ال كارنتين`, `ليفوفلوكساسين` with `ليفوكسين`).\n   - **Legitimate Learnings from Gemini**:\n     - `0.25mg = 250mcg = 25. مجم = ربع` (`بالموكورت 25. مجم` $\\leftrightarrow$ `بالمكيرت ربع`).\n     - Strip-to-tablet math: 3 strips $\\times$ 4 tablets = 12 tablets (`فايركتا 3 شريط` $\\leftrightarrow$ `فايركتا 12 قرص`).\n     - Visually confused OCR letters: `سيفيتيل` $\\leftrightarrow$ `سيديتيل` (ف vs د).\n2. **System Prompt Hardening in `src/fast_match/coordinator.py`**:\n   - Rule 1 (Brand Identity): Added rule that distinct commercial prefixes (`نيو`/`New`) and suffixes (`-يتش` vs `-ين`) are different brands $\\rightarrow$ `no_match`. Added OCR visual confusion (`ف` vs `د`).\n   - Rule 2 (Formulation): Added strict rule that combination suffixes (`كو`, `بلس`, `كومب` / `Co`, `Plus`, `Comp`) must never match plain single-ingredient products $\\rightarrow$ `no_match`.\n   - Rule 3 (Strength): Added vernacular and fractional equivalencies: `1000mg = 1gm`, `500mg = 0.5gm = نص`, `0.25mg = 250mcg = 25. مجم = ربع`.\n   - Rule 4 (Packaging): Added strip-to-tablet equivalence rule and explicit wholesale packaging rule (`32ب`, `باكت`, `كرتونة`).\n3. **Core Search & Normalization Upgrades (`src/fast_match/search.py` & `src/match/text_match.py`)**:\n   - Persian/Urdu OCR normalization (`ی` $\\rightarrow$ `ي`, `ک` $\\rightarrow$ `ك`, `پ` $\\rightarrow$ `ب`, Eastern digits).\n   - Punctuation/slash separation in `extract_form_group` and `extract_brand_tokens`.\n   - Stopwords expanded with `عادي`, `عادى`, `مركب`.\n\n### In Progress:\n- Packaging into `dist_production/` using `scripts/package_production.py` for the latest prompt changes.\n- Formulating the direct Arabic response to the user's question: \"هل أنت أضفت الحاجات اللي احنا لاحظناها ديت في الـ system بتاعنا؟ تقترح إيه دلوقتي نعمله؟\"\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Gemini's 112 Matches are Flawed**: The higher count in Gemini was an artifact of data fabrication (altering numbers in the warehouse data), accepting forbidden brand substitutes, and swapping warehouse files.\n- **Wholesale \"32ب\" Meaning**: \"ب\" is standard Egyptian pharmaceutical shorthand for \"باكت\" (carton of 32 boxes). Our system putting `افيرو كوكسبيب 90مجم-32ب` in \"يحتاج مراجعة\" is the medically and commercially correct behavior.\n- **Pulmicort Discovery**: Pulmicort 0.25mg in Egyptian hospitals and pharmacies is universally called \"بالميكورت ربع\". Adding fractional equivalence enables this genuine match.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Workspace**: `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy`\n- **Output File**: `data/processes/PROC-001/results_PROC-001.xlsx`\n- **Python Executable**: `d:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.e