es not explicitly state the pack size (e.g. standard listing without count):\n        THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")! NEVER mark this as review!\n      - STRIP-TO-TABLET EQUIVALENCE: When a shortage requests standard blisters/strips (e.g. 3 شريط) and the warehouse lists the standard full pack tablet count for that drug (e.g. 12 tablets where each strip has 4 tablets, like فايركتا), this is a 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\n      - Manufacturer suffixes (/فاركو, /جلاكسو), commercial indicators (\"س ج\", \"سعر جديد\", \"سعر قديم\") do not change the product.","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\fast_match\\coordinator.py","toolAction":"Editing file","toolSummary":"Make system prompt examples generic"}}]}
